  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>As we know, if two circles intersect each other, then<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>&#60;</mo><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> ........(i)<br /><br />Now for the first circle <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>8</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>10</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>r</mi></math><br /><br />For the second circle <math><msub><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>4</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>7</mn></mrow></mfenced></math> and <math><msub><mrow><mi>r</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></math><br /><br />From (i)<br /><br /><math><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&amp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"}\" open=\"{\"><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mrow><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable columnalign=\"left\"><mtr><mtd><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>ii</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;</p><p>when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>6</mn></math>&nbsp;then&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>6</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>when&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>6</mn><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>r</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>11</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mo>.</mo><mfenced><mi>vi</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>from&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>iv</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced><mi>vi</mi></mfenced></math>&nbsp;we get</p><p><math><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>r</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mn>11</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>"
